# Copy to .env for local development. Never commit .env or real credentials.
# Stage 00 needs no environment variables. Provider keys are added in the
# stage that first uses them (e.g. Stage 05 AI-search adapters), for example:
# EXAMPLE_PROVIDER_API_KEY=

# Optional agent (Day 5, `pip install -e '.[agent]'`). Get a key at https://openrouter.ai.
# Export it in your shell or put it in an untracked .env; never commit it.
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
